{"id":1040501,"chapter_id":1040501,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"N.F.112年10月13日 下午13：21\nMBCC管理局 局长办公室","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"妙梦瓶为这座城市带来的混乱刚刚平息，你和MBCC的收尾工作也差不多告一段落。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"小文","content":"这就是所有的行动报告书啦~等局长你签好字就可以拿去归档了。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"options":["等会儿来找夜莺拿吧"],"style":6,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501004,"trial_step":4,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"等会儿来找夜莺拿吧","goto":5}]},{"step":5,"speaker":"小文","content":"夜莺副官今天出外勤，走之前还特意让我来监督局长认真工作，别到处乱跑。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"……","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"小文","content":"……啊，眼神！眼神错开了，局长心虚了！","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"追踪队长","content":"局长，有未知禁闭者到达MBCC。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"options":["需要枷锁是吧，我马上——"],"style":6,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501009,"trial_step":9,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"需要枷锁是吧，我马上——","goto":10}]},{"step":10,"speaker":"追踪队长","content":"不……那个，对方不是抓捕对象……那位是由上级机关直接护送来的，是位高权限人士。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"追踪队长","content":"按通知，她<color=#fb9259>不需要</color>枷锁。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"说着，一份简短的信报传到你通信器上。只有很简单的几行字——","style":14,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"观察员，瑟琳-禁闭者检查报告M值463，精神稳定，无外显狂厄能力，无攻击性。\n对象在公共事业部履职8年，信任度高。此后一段时间内也将协助MBCC的日常工作与作战行动。","style":14,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"经FAC、第九机关、上庭确认，<color=#fb9259>无需给对象施加枷锁</color>。\n她是您的合作伙伴。","style":14,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"options":["……这人现在在哪？"],"style":6,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501015,"trial_step":15,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……这人现在在哪？","goto":16}]},{"step":16,"speaker":"追踪队长","content":"对象已前往审查室，局长。她希望见您一面。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"你快步走进审查室，正好与对面的女子对上眼神。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1040500},{"step":18,"content":"大衣、手套、长裙——她身上几乎没有裸露在外的皮肤，让你无从下手。除此之外，她身边悬浮着一颗不知作用的黑色石英。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1040500},{"step":19,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"这场见面本该更早一点的。唤夏公馆的晚会我也去了，可惜没来得及和你搭话。那身礼服很适合你，非常好看。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1040500},{"step":20,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"——好久不见，亲爱的局长。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1040500},{"step":21,"content":"名为瑟琳的女人坐在你面前，她带着微笑，平静柔和地注视着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1040500},{"step":22,"content":"多数禁闭者的身上都带有无法抑制的躁动，他们难以控制住狂厄带来的疯狂。但她看上去不一样。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1040500},{"step":23,"content":"……甚至，让你感觉有些熟悉。她认识你吗？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1040500},{"step":24,"options":["你是谁？","好久不见"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501026,"trial_step":26,"course":3,"drawing":1040500,"choices":[{"text":"你是谁？","goto":27},{"text":"好久不见","goto":29}]},{"step":25,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"我听说了，那场暴动后你失去了大多数记忆，应该也不记得我了。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1040500},{"step":26,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"既然如此，就让我再进行一次自我介绍吧。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1040502,"next":[31]},{"step":27,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"不用紧张，我知道你被管理局那次暴乱影响了恢复进程，现在记忆可能还有些混乱。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1040500},{"step":28,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"你大概已经不记得我了吧？","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1040502},{"step":29,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"我是瑟琳，受人所托来看看MBCC还有局长的情况，或许有什么我可以帮忙的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1040500},{"step":30,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"接下来可能要打扰你们一段时间了，${PlayerName}。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1040500},{"step":31,"options":["我们之前认识吗？"],"voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501033,"trial_step":33,"course":3,"drawing":1040502,"choices":[{"text":"我们之前认识吗？","goto":34}]},{"step":32,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"嗯，我们之前在MBCC见过面，有过深入接触。你给我留下很好的印象，或许可以称为<color=#fb9259>朋友</color>吧——我是这么希望的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1040503},{"step":33,"content":"——失忆前的你，和某位来自上级的、未上枷锁的禁闭者，是“朋友”？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1040503},{"step":34,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"你看起来有些意外。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1040502},{"step":35,"options":["很少见身居高位的禁闭者","你是个很让人意外的“朋友”"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501037,"trial_step":37,"course":3,"drawing":1040500,"choices":[{"text":"很少见身居高位的禁闭者","goto":38},{"text":"你是个很让人意外的“朋友”","goto":40}]},{"step":36,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"是吗。第九机关的兰利女士就是很强大的禁闭者，以她的性格应该从不掩饰这一点。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1040502},{"step":37,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"还是说你把自己的直属上级忘了？那她可要找上门了。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1040502,"next":[42]},{"step":38,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"是的。你也可以把它当作我单方面的想法，不必介意。友情需要共同的记忆感情支撑，目前那份美好回忆就交给我保管吧。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1040502},{"step":39,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"把我看作新认识的同事也好，我很乐意跟你重新开始。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1040502},{"step":40,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"有什么疑问尽管提吧，这才是我申请“额外审查”的目的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1040500},{"step":41,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"好不容易再见你一面，我也不想让你露出这样紧张不安的表情。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1040504},{"step":42,"content":"她松弛的笑容里像透过一丝似有若无的无奈。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1040500},{"step":43,"content":"你想了想，决定从一个简单的东西入手，便指向她身旁的怪异漂浮物。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1040500},{"step":44,"options":["这是什么东西？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501046,"trial_step":46,"course":3,"drawing":1040500,"choices":[{"text":"这是什么东西？","goto":47}]},{"step":45,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"叫它黑石英吧，这是黑环研究院的新发明。我没有能独立战斗保护自己的能力，上级就安排它来，负责护卫、通信、信息收集与分析等等工作。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1040500},{"step":46,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"MBCC对禁闭者的提升素材对我来说没什么效果，但共享给它的话，也能在分析计算后提升自己的战斗效率，更好地保护大家。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1040503},{"step":47,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"它是个可靠的陪伴。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1040502},{"step":48,"content":"得到夸奖后，黑色的石质三角哔哔地动了动，像迫不及待要证明自己“能干”一般变起了形，在空间中投影出一份相当正式的官方文件。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1040500},{"step":49,"content":"在上面，你看到了MBCC、FAC、第九机关、以及一个在众多重大文件上都见过的图章。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1040500},{"step":50,"content":"不久前BR-001结束后那场严密审查里，审查你的对象也有这个图案。这个图章来自哪里，你也隐约有了想法。","style":3,"background":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1040500},{"step":51,"options":["你来自上庭"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501053,"trial_step":53,"course":3,"drawing":1040500,"choices":[{"text":"你来自上庭","goto":54}]},{"step":52,"content":"<color=#fb9259>上庭</color>，狄斯人口口相传的秘密之地，似乎与奇兰博士的继承息息相关。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1040500},{"step":53,"content":"官方系统对它的描述模棱两可，“专注探索发展，延续人类文明。”它确实远离城邦生活，罕见有明确的职权，却又对包括FAC、市议会在内的重要机构有着很大影响力。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1040500},{"step":54,"content":"你有幸接触过它们，也并没被善待，自然对这群神秘贵人没有好感。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1040500},{"step":55,"options":["没想到上庭还会关注我","没想到上庭这么关注MBCC"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501057,"trial_step":57,"course":3,"drawing":1040500,"choices":[{"text":"没想到上庭还会关注我","goto":58},{"text":"没想到上庭这么关注MBCC","goto":58}]},{"step":56,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"我能理解，在你看来，上庭与你的关系应该一直很紧张。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1040502},{"step":57,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"我不想对你有所隐瞒。没错，上庭一直关注着你，特别是这两次黑环事件中你的表现。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1040500},{"step":58,"content":"关注？还是戒备？在这之前，我跟你们唯一的接触，是一次长达2周的关押和审查。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1040500},{"step":59,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"直说讨厌它吧，你是个坦率的人，对我不必遮掩。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1040502},{"step":60,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"除了民众间的不实妄想外，上庭并不讨人喜欢，他们也很有自知之明。我从你这儿的加班同事们口中学到一句话，很适合形容上庭人对此的态度：","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1040503},{"step":61,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"——“麻了，开摆。”","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1040503},{"step":62,"content":"作为局长，你差点呛着。瑟琳就这么看着你的反应，眉眼带笑，像在享受，又像真的很满足。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1040502},{"step":63,"content":"这笑容一闪而逝。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1040500},{"step":64,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"以你现在的权限，我还不能透露太多它的真实情况。但上庭的立场是无需掩盖的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1040500},{"step":65,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"上庭自诞生起，就只有一个目的——从灾厄死局中寻找延续人类文明的渺茫解法。这是他们唯一的立场，为此可以付出所有。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1040503},{"step":66,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"世俗的一切对它都不构成诱惑，反过来，他们也必须竭力摆脱世俗人情，才能简化复杂的现实难题，也因此难免行事冷酷僵硬。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1040500},{"step":67,"options":["你想说他们跟FAC一样？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501069,"trial_step":69,"course":3,"drawing":1040500,"choices":[{"text":"你想说他们跟FAC一样？","goto":70}]},{"step":68,"content":"瑟琳耸耸肩。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1040500},{"step":69,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"FAC可比他们受欢迎多了。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1040502},{"step":70,"options":["那你呢？上庭的观察员"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501072,"trial_step":72,"course":3,"drawing":1040500,"choices":[{"text":"那你呢？上庭的观察员","goto":73}]},{"step":71,"content":"我那“素未谋面的来自上庭的朋友”，以及，这次“友好访问”……我该如何理解你的到来？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1040503},{"step":72,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"既有他们对你的关注，也包含我想念你的小小私心。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1040500},{"step":73,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"上庭已经认可你至今为止所有努力，他们需要你，也希望向你传达这点。当然，他们也自知没有这份亲和力能重获你的信任。所以他们才特别批准我来。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1040500},{"step":74,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"因为知道你我过去有些交流，他们认为由我送上问候会得到一个好点的结果吧。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1040500},{"step":75,"content":"……这算是他们的宽容，还是某种伪装？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1040500},{"step":76,"content":"作为上庭的代表，你对我有什么指示？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1040500},{"step":77,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"抛开我的个人感情，从公务和理性的角度，我想告诉你……","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1040504},{"step":78,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"任何势力都有自己的立场，但只要由人组成，必然会有不同的视角和理解。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1040500},{"step":79,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"你有强大而未知的力量，每个组织都有忌惮你，憎恶你，或是垂涎你的人。每个阶段，人们看你的目光都可能变化。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1040501},{"step":80,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"所以，明确你自己的信念，睁大眼睛，吸收一切情报，找到能为你所用的、能为你所信的力量，这才是你该考虑的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1040500},{"step":81,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"至少你们在大立场上并不冲突，你不会为一己私利煽动狂厄，就不是上庭势不两立的敌人，也就存在可以共进的道路。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1040500},{"step":82,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"我希望如此。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1040502},{"step":83,"content":"她看着你，毫无遮掩，说得坦荡，反而让你有些语塞。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1040500},{"step":84,"options":["……那从你个人感情的角度呢？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501086,"trial_step":86,"course":3,"drawing":1040500,"choices":[{"text":"……那从你个人感情的角度呢？","goto":87}]},{"step":85,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"当然是想见你。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1040502},{"step":86,"content":"笑容再次绽放在她脸上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1040502},{"step":87,"content":"仿佛终于完成了枯燥的工作，周末下班放风一样，瑟琳放松地靠在审查椅上，就像倚在深夜吧台，欣然享受你久别的陪伴。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1040500},{"step":88,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"来说说你的冒险吧。从你醒来到现在也有2个多月了，听说你去了很多地方，见过很多人。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1040501},{"step":89,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"你比以前胖了些，也更有朝气，这里的人说你很受爱戴。一定交了很多朋友吧？告诉我，那些开心快乐或是烦恼的事，你的收获和担忧。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1040503},{"step":90,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"很久不见，我想知道你过得怎么样。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1040502},{"step":91,"content":"审查室里的气氛变了，好像被拉到一个你并不记得却十分亲近的过去，让人有些晃神。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1040502},{"step":92,"options":["还行","疲于工作","老被绑架"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501094,"trial_step":94,"course":3,"drawing":1040502,"choices":[{"text":"还行","goto":95},{"text":"疲于工作","goto":97},{"text":"老被绑架","goto":99}]},{"step":93,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"这么谦虚？从报告里看，你的成绩可不只是“还行”能概括的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1040502},{"step":94,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"好了别吊我胃口了，我期待了很久的。说说吧。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1040501,"next":[102]},{"step":95,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"明明有那么优秀的副官辅佐？呵呵，我听说了，你很爱冒险，做了不少惊世骇俗的事。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1040502},{"step":96,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"来，说说，我会帮你保密的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1040501,"next":[102]},{"step":97,"content":"她没忍住笑出了声。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1040502},{"step":98,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"噗，那可不得了。你是我方重要人物，被人拐走可不行。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1040502},{"step":99,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"所以，都是谁这么有胆量来挑战你，我们的米诺斯局长又是怎么出奇制胜的？","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1040501},{"step":100,"content":"她催促道，却只是看着你，眼里尽是温柔的等待。好像就这么逗你已经很让她愉快似的，好像这样的时间有多值得慢慢品味。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1040500},{"step":101,"content":"……反正她肯定会看报告，那就说些无伤大雅的事吧。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1040500},{"step":102,"content":"你沉默半响，终于开口。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1040500},{"step":103,"content":"……我醒来就遭遇了暴动，有个很奇怪的女人中断了记忆修复程序，破坏了我的记忆。大多数禁闭者都逃了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1040500},{"step":104,"content":"然后我们得到情报，说她去了辛迪加……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1040500},{"step":105,"content":"你慢慢说着，最开始还在小心斟酌词句。慢慢地，随着缓慢揭开的过往，回顾这一路，某些更深沉更复杂的情感涌了上来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1040500},{"step":106,"content":"我去了很多地方，辛迪加、锈河、砂海、新城……还有黑环。事情一波一波地来，说实话，应接不暇，也吃了很多苦头。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1040504},{"step":107,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"是呢……报告上写得简单，真经历起来可不是几页纸能概括的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1040504},{"step":108,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"现在呢，醒来后的世界对你而言还那么可怕吗？","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1040504},{"step":109,"content":"……我不知道，我看不透这个世界。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1040504},{"step":110,"content":"很长一段时间，我不知道能做什么、该做什么，能自保已经竭尽全力了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1040504},{"step":111,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"但你走过来了，你现在站稳了脚跟，这个管理局就是你的堡垒。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1040500},{"step":112,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"你已经安全了，还能给更多人提供庇护。每一个禁闭者都从你身上得到力量，这一路也有很多人因你得到救赎。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1040500},{"step":113,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"大家信任着你，我看得出来。这就是你最大的成就。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_118"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1040503},{"step":114,"content":"……我没有那么厉害。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1040504},{"step":115,"content":"有很多我无法理解的事，也有我理解、却无能为力的事。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1040504},{"step":116,"content":"情绪被揭开，你感到心脏被堵住，试图控制自己，便低下头捂住了眼睛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1040504},{"step":117,"content":"我得到很多帮助，有些却再也无法回报。我愿意为这个城邦做点什么，但，我不知道该怎么做。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1040504},{"step":118,"content":"……没人告诉我该怎么做。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1040504},{"step":119,"content":"你抬起头，看向瑟琳。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1040504},{"step":120,"options":["你说你是过去的我的朋友"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501132,"trial_step":132,"course":3,"drawing":1040504,"choices":[{"text":"你说你是过去的我的朋友","goto":133}]},{"step":121,"content":"过去的我是什么样的人？遇到这种事，他会怎么做？","female_content":"以前的我是什么样的人？遇到这种事，她会怎么做？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1040504},{"step":122,"content":"会做的更好吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1040504},{"step":123,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1040503},{"step":124,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"我见你的机会并不多，无法细致推测你每一步的行为。不如说，每次见你都能见到些意外之举。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1040503},{"step":125,"content":"像是被你的话引出了潺潺的回忆，她垂下双眸，缓缓说着。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1040503},{"step":126,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"<color=#fb9259>第一次</color>见你，还是今年，就在这里，你还没有失去记忆。那时候的你非常坦率，喜怒尽形于色，从不掩饰，也总是非常坚持，不顾后果，横冲直撞。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1040503},{"step":127,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"我停留的时间并不长，但足够见证你惹的种种祸事，很让管理局的人头疼。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1040502},{"step":128,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"<color=#fb9259>第二次</color>，上个月，在唤夏公馆。那是个意外，你穿着漂亮的礼服，我一看就知道那是任务伪装，不好打扰。但我看到你被另一个意料之外的人搭话。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_134"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1040500},{"step":129,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"那个禁闭者挑衅了你，破坏你的计划，换作以前你一定大发雷霆。但彼时你却很妥善地应对过去，同时又保留了那么点小脾气，不给对方台阶下。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1040502},{"step":130,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"<color=#fb9259>第三次</color>，就是现在。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1040503},{"step":131,"content":"瑟琳笑眯眯地看着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1040500},{"step":132,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"你已经学会顺着我的话，一边坦诚自己的真心赢取我的信任让我心软，一边自然而然地向我套话，想借着我了解自己还无权解锁的<color=#fb9259>过去</color>。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501144,"trial_step":144,"drawing":1040502},{"step":133,"options":["……","没有的事，我没那么聪明"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501145,"trial_step":145,"course":3,"drawing":1040500,"choices":[{"text":"……","goto":146},{"text":"没有的事，我没那么聪明","goto":146}]},{"step":134,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"别误会，我没有责怪你。我很欣慰。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_140"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501146,"trial_step":146,"drawing":1040502},{"step":135,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"清醒的世界太过复杂。隔着那些冰冷的报告，我看你走的每一步都让人心惊肉跳，我没办法来看你，只能兀自担心。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_141"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1040503},{"step":136,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"现在见了面，我安心了。你不断成长着，变得更成熟、稳重，也更会思考。至少以后不会有谁能轻易打垮你。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_142"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501148,"trial_step":148,"drawing":1040503},{"step":137,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"更重要的是，你变了那么多，却还有些东西没有改变。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_143"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1040500},{"step":138,"content":"她站了起来，走向你。伸手轻轻触碰你的指尖，然后有些迟疑地向前，轻触你的掌心，终于安静地握住你的手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501150,"trial_step":150,"drawing":1040507},{"step":139,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"我们也曾经像这样握手，我还记得当时的触感，也记得那时的你。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501151,"trial_step":151,"drawing":1040507},{"step":140,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"你还是那么执拗，所用的一切手段都为坚持自我，你不会轻易认输。我喜欢这种叛逆的孩子。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_146"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1040506},{"step":141,"content":"……是这样吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1040506},{"step":142,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"是的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_148"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501154,"trial_step":154,"drawing":1040505},{"step":143,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"回到你的问题。你问我，如果是曾经的你，会不会做得更好。我的回答是，不会。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_149"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501155,"trial_step":155,"drawing":1040501},{"step":144,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"你一直在前进。失去记忆也不能拖慢你的脚步，你仍旧向前走着。走的每一步，都是自己当下能做到的最好。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_150"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1040507},{"step":145,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"但我也做不到轻描淡写地为你鼓掌。因为你经历的痛苦和失去都是真真切切的，我感同身受。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_151"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501157,"trial_step":157,"drawing":1040506},{"step":146,"content":"手套逐渐染上你们二人的体温，像在缓慢溶解，再也阻隔不了什么。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501158,"trial_step":158,"drawing":1040506},{"step":147,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"今天的我已经不被允许摘下这双手套与你接触，我们都有不可逾越的立场，但你应该能感受我的心情。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_153"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1040507},{"step":148,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"我们注定失去，但只要你还向前走，你所牵挂的思念的人与事，终究在终点，在蓝色的花海与你重逢。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_154"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501160,"trial_step":160,"drawing":1040507},{"step":149,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"而那些你所忘记的，无可挽回也无处缅怀的……","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_155"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501161,"trial_step":161,"drawing":1040506},{"step":150,"content":"握着你的手微微用力了些。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1040506},{"step":151,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"……别担心，就算只有一点，我也会替你记得。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_157"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1040507},{"step":152,"content":"你忘记自己要说什么了，语言如此苍白，像所有的算计都不及肢体的诚实。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501164,"trial_step":164,"drawing":1040507},{"step":153,"content":"立场、身份、情报、警戒、甚至你们所在的这个审查室都变得模糊，都不重要。那被唤醒的一路走来的疲惫与孤独，那对苍白过去的茫然和失重，此时都化成控制不住的本能。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1040507},{"step":154,"content":"你看着她的眼睛，回握她的手，在柔软掌心传递出来的是隐忍和深切的眷恋，让你渴求更多，渴望她告诉你更多。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501166,"trial_step":166,"drawing":1040507},{"step":155,"options":["……我想知道……告诉我……"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501167,"trial_step":167,"course":3,"drawing":1040507,"choices":[{"text":"……我想知道……告诉我……","goto":168}]},{"step":156,"speaker":"？？","content":"局长！","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_162"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501168,"trial_step":168,"drawing":1040507},{"step":157,"content":"审查室的大门被人猛地推开，你看到夜莺冲进来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1040501},{"step":158,"content":"夜莺焦急的神情凝固在脸上，逐渐变为一种你从未在她脸上见过，也无法理解的……恐慌。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501170,"trial_step":170,"drawing":1040501},{"step":159,"content":"她视线的末端，正是那位上庭“来客”。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501171,"trial_step":171,"drawing":1040501},{"step":160,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……没想到您会亲自过来，女士。这里有一份紧急文书需要局长批复，可以借出几分钟时间吗？","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_166"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501172,"trial_step":172,"drawing":1040501},{"step":161,"content":"一股诡异的气氛弥漫开来，瞬间驱散了刚刚的恍惚。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501173,"trial_step":173,"drawing":1040501},{"step":162,"content":"瑟琳看了看她，又把视线移到你身上，她微微一笑，松开了你的手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501174,"trial_step":174,"drawing":1040505},{"step":163,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"去吧。副官着急了，我把你还给她。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_169"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501175,"trial_step":175,"drawing":1040502},{"step":164,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"这以后，我们还有很多时间。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_170"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501176,"trial_step":176,"drawing":1040502},{"step":165,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……感谢您的理解。局长，请跟我来，拜托了。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_171"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501177,"trial_step":177,"drawing":1040502},{"step":166,"content":"你跟着夜莺走出禁闭室。她没有再提任何文书，反而紧张地拉住你。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501178,"trial_step":178},{"step":167,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您对她使用过枷锁了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_173"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501179,"trial_step":179},{"step":168,"content":"暂时没有。这位是来自上庭的考察官，危险性很低，不需要MBCC辅助管制。怎么了？","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501180,"trial_step":180},{"step":169,"content":"夜莺点了点头，但身体仍旧紧绷。她快速地低声说道。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501181,"trial_step":181},{"step":170,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……我明白了。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_176"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501182,"trial_step":182},{"step":171,"content":"她在颤抖。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501183,"trial_step":183},{"step":172,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"抱歉，是我反应过度。她……的确是位很重要的人物，无论如何，您一定要安全通过这次<color=#fb9259>考察</color>。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_178"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501184,"trial_step":184},{"step":173,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"别的……什么都不要问。拜托您……","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_179"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501185,"trial_step":185},{"step":174,"content":"夜莺没有再多解释自己的反应，匆匆离开。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501186,"trial_step":186},{"step":175,"content":"…………？","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501187,"trial_step":187},{"step":176,"content":"你拉开一只抽屉，被飞扬的尘土呛个正着。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501188,"trial_step":188},{"step":177,"speaker":"小文","content":"管理局之前的资料应该都放在这个书架上了——咳咳咳，好久没有打扫了，咳，有点……乱……","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_184"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501189,"trial_step":189},{"step":178,"options":["搜索访客记录"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501190,"trial_step":190,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"搜索访客记录","goto":191}]},{"step":179,"content":"瑟琳……上庭…………","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501191,"trial_step":191},{"step":180,"content":"无论你如何搜索都没有结果。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501192,"trial_step":192},{"step":181,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"嗯，我们之前在MBCC见过面，有过深入接触。你给我留下很好的印象，或许可以称为<color=#fb9259>朋友</color>吧——我是这么希望的。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501193,"trial_step":193},{"step":182,"content":"只要到访都会留下记录，为什么查不到？","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501194,"trial_step":194},{"step":183,"options":["询问小文"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501195,"trial_step":195,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"询问小文","goto":196}]},{"step":184,"speaker":"小文","content":"其他的资料？有哦有哦，这里还封存这更高权限的内容，那都是管理局传说级别的有趣东西哦～！","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_191"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501196,"trial_step":196},{"step":185,"speaker":"小文","content":"不过暴乱之后局内的安保等级提升了，那些资料大概都被彻底封存起来了吧，我的权限不够用呢。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_192"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501197,"trial_step":197},{"step":186,"options":["使用局长权限"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501198,"trial_step":198,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"使用局长权限","goto":199}]},{"step":187,"content":"访问被拒绝了。小文似乎没有注意到你的操作，一边整理书架，一边还随口聊着。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501199,"trial_step":199},{"step":188,"speaker":"小文","content":"——再往前的资料我也不太熟悉啦，那会儿我还没入职呢！欸，这么说来，好像入职之后见到局长也不过是这几个月的事情……之前局长都在干什么呢……？","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_195"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501200,"trial_step":200},{"step":189,"content":"…………","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501201,"trial_step":201},{"step":190,"options":["查询和自己有关的记录"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501202,"trial_step":202,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"查询和自己有关的记录","goto":203}]},{"step":191,"content":"这些是MBCC近一年的日常工作记录。和你的名字，和MBCC局长有关的条目，数量为0。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501203,"trial_step":203},{"step":192,"content":"“局长”这个职位在MBCC缺失了近乎一整年，一切公务交由临时负责人夜莺。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501204,"trial_step":204},{"step":193,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"<color=#fb9259>第一次</color>见你，还是今年，就在这里，你还没有失去记忆。那时候的你非常坦率，喜怒尽形于色，从不掩饰，也总是非常坚持，不顾后果，横冲直撞。","voice":["vo_trial_040501_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_shalom_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501205,"trial_step":205,"drawing":1040503},{"step":194,"content":"那时候的你在哪？如果你不是局长，那瑟琳来探望的又是谁？如果是你，又是什么身份的“你”？","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501206,"trial_step":206},{"step":195,"content":"当年的她抱着什么样的目的，做了什么？现在的她重返故地，又有什么目的？","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501207,"trial_step":207},{"step":196,"content":"无数疑问充满你的脑海，最后化为两条清晰的线索。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501208,"trial_step":208},{"step":197,"content":"——失忆前的你，究竟是谁？","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501209,"trial_step":209},{"step":198,"content":"——这个“不能”被套上枷锁的女人，又会是谁？","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":140501210,"trial_step":210}]}